1
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:44,240
"My Secret Vampire"

2
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:48,700
(Episode 8)

3
00:01:33,510 --> 00:01:34,510
Hmm.

4
00:01:39,150 --> 00:01:41,340
So it's not really a cult...

5
00:01:41,750 --> 00:01:43,296
Your dream isn't to be a priest, is it?

6
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:44,160
Do you like garlic?

7
00:01:44,210 --> 00:01:45,880
Are you good at reading people?

8
00:01:48,850 --> 00:01:51,450
Juwon probably doesn't eat
things like ginger or garlic...

9
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:54,590
Not being able to eat
those things is a bit...

10
00:02:47,250 --> 00:02:48,550
Is anyone here?

11
00:04:08,950 --> 00:04:10,630
Is this what you wanted to do?

12
00:04:12,380 --> 00:04:14,066
You really don't want to
take this picture, do you?

13
00:04:14,090 --> 00:04:16,170
You look like you could
shoot lasers from your eyes.

14
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,200
There's something wrong with the camera.

15
00:04:20,330 --> 00:04:21,530
I'm keeping this one, then.

16
00:04:25,130 --> 00:04:27,320
You should be more honest with yourself.

17
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:29,540
I try to do that every time.

18
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:31,960
Even though it always feels
like I'm the one who loses.

19
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:35,000
But I don't mind.

20
00:04:35,460 --> 00:04:37,206
Because I'm not good
at hiding my feelings...

21
00:04:37,230 --> 00:04:39,310
You weren't scared that I'd find out.

22
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:41,590
You were scared that I'd get hurt.

23
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,500
But I still like you.

24
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,520
What am I supposed to do...?

25
00:05:00,050 --> 00:05:01,250
Juwon?

26
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,000
I've missed you so much.

27
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:24,100
Dongha.

28
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,360
Why did you come all the way
here in this cold, dressed like that?

29
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:03,460
Because I was in a hurry to see you.

30
00:06:05,350 --> 00:06:07,360
It was farther than I thought.

31
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,920
You.

32
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:18,470
What were you thinking,

33
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:20,080
coming all the way out here?

34
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:27,000
A vampire, living right
in the middle of the city...!

35
00:06:28,570 --> 00:06:29,670
I was thinking.

36
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,320
Maybe I should just expose all of you.

37
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:35,380
Just kidding.

38
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:37,760
Jeez.

39
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:53,950
What are you doing?

40
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:56,980
I thought you couldn't sleep on the floor.

41
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,180
I'll just sleep here.

42
00:06:59,900 --> 00:07:02,380
You're being so nice to me all of a sudden.
I'm not used to it.

43
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,940
Just sleep here with me.

44
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:12,660
Huh?

45
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:15,670
It's not like we haven't
slept in the same bed before.

46
00:07:23,290 --> 00:07:24,490
When was this?

47
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:27,220
The day of my birthday party.

48
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,250
But you look like you're about to cry.

49
00:07:42,110 --> 00:07:44,260
Because none of my friends were my age.

50
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:47,260
They were all old enough
to be my grandparents.

51
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,520
I see.

52
00:07:52,130 --> 00:07:53,480
When I was about your age,

53
00:07:53,690 --> 00:07:54,890
I used to cry a lot, too.

54
00:07:56,970 --> 00:07:57,970
Why?

55
00:07:58,690 --> 00:08:00,250
Because I didn't want to drink blood...

56
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:05,750
I didn't even know I
was a vampire back then.

57
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:09,670
Is that even possible?

58
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:14,600
When the Father first found me,

59
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,250
he said I was very sick.

60
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:24,240
So he turned me into a
vampire to save my life.

61
00:08:25,810 --> 00:08:26,810
I see...

62
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:29,840
Oh, right...

63
00:08:31,490 --> 00:08:32,490
That day...

64
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:35,530
I thought your wound was poisoned,

65
00:08:36,370 --> 00:08:38,290
- I was trying to suck out the poison...
- Hey...

66
00:08:40,460 --> 00:08:42,640
Do you feel very tired right now?

67
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:45,150
No.

68
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:46,980
Why?

69
00:08:54,420 --> 00:08:55,420
When I was little,

70
00:08:56,650 --> 00:08:58,980
I loved looking at the sky from here.

71
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:08,050
What star is that?

72
00:09:10,190 --> 00:09:12,950
Just because I live in the country
doesn't make me an expert on stars.

73
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:17,120
I don't know. It could be space junk.

74
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:19,420
But who cares?

75
00:09:20,050 --> 00:09:21,810
It's beautiful, and
that's all that matters.

76
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:23,510
That's enough.

77
00:09:24,590 --> 00:09:25,590
It is beautiful.

78
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:37,820
Huh?

79
00:09:37,990 --> 00:09:39,450
Hey, how do you have this...?

80
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,780
It found its way back to its owner.

81
00:09:52,210 --> 00:09:53,410
Why does it look like this?

82
00:09:54,510 --> 00:09:55,510
Ah.

83
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:57,470
Silver isn't good for us.

84
00:10:00,010 --> 00:10:02,040
- Then take it off!
- It's fine.

85
00:10:02,210 --> 00:10:03,530
Why are you still wearing it?

86
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,650
I told you, it's fine.

87
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:05,680
Here, give it to me.

88
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:14,220
I like you.

89
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:15,910
Dongha.

90
00:10:33,890 --> 00:10:35,090
Actually,

91
00:10:36,230 --> 00:10:37,820
I've regretted

92
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:40,660
leaving like that the other day.

93
00:10:42,410 --> 00:10:44,610
I couldn't stop myself
from falling for you...

94
00:10:47,570 --> 00:10:48,570
I was worried that you

95
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:50,980
might get hurt because of me.

96
00:10:53,530 --> 00:10:54,730
I was so scared.

97
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,090
I want to be honest, like you said.

98
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:05,460
That's why I gathered
the courage to come here.

99
00:11:11,460 --> 00:11:12,700
Why aren't you saying anything?

100
00:11:16,390 --> 00:11:17,390
My answer.

101
00:11:29,210 --> 00:11:30,520
Let's go home together.

102
00:11:31,660 --> 00:11:32,760
Everyone misses you.

103
00:11:33,570 --> 00:11:35,270
Can I really go back?

104
00:11:35,570 --> 00:11:36,570
Of course.

105
00:11:37,130 --> 00:11:38,230
It's our home.

106
00:12:05,790 --> 00:12:06,790
You're alone?

107
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,600
What?

108
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:13,660
What's with that reaction?

109
00:12:15,330 --> 00:12:16,330
It's nothing.

110
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:17,500
It's just that...

111
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,140
I got my hopes up for nothing.

112
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:20,780
What were you hoping for?

113
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,800
Was it... me?

114
00:12:26,940 --> 00:12:27,990
Dongha!

115
00:12:28,010 --> 00:12:30,316
- We missed you like crazy!
- Dongha! We really missed you.

116
00:12:30,340 --> 00:12:32,090
I know, I know.

117
00:12:32,110 --> 00:12:33,250
Didn't you miss us at all?

118
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:35,180
We've been waiting for you for so long.

119
00:12:35,210 --> 00:12:36,300
I know, right?

120
00:12:38,889 --> 00:12:42,522
(Contract for Rental Tenancy Extension)

121
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:43,890
Let's all get along!

122
00:12:46,090 --> 00:12:47,190
That won't be necessary.

123
00:12:47,990 --> 00:12:49,079
As long as we respect
each other's privacy...

124
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:49,670
Here we go again.

125
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:51,620
What do you even mean by "privacy"?

126
00:12:52,220 --> 00:12:54,820
Do you vampires have
some big secret to hide?

127
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:57,730
I wasn't talking about myself.
I was talking about you guys.

128
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:58,740
You guys.

129
00:12:59,190 --> 00:13:01,250
You'd better not let me catch you.

130
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:04,500
Hey, we're not scumbags.

131
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:05,620
Yeah, really.

132
00:13:05,810 --> 00:13:08,270
Our dear Dongha. I'm going
to take good care of you.

133
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,140
Hey, get away from him.

134
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:11,460
Hey! Let go of him!

135
00:13:11,490 --> 00:13:12,860
You seem to really like him.

136
00:13:17,010 --> 00:13:18,010
Hey, guys!

137
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,960
I'm hungry.

138
00:13:23,620 --> 00:13:25,100
Let's eat!

139
00:13:31,420 --> 00:13:32,420
Wow.

140
00:13:33,370 --> 00:13:34,570
This is the taste I remember.

141
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:36,000
I could cry.

142
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:37,340
Hey.

143
00:13:37,370 --> 00:13:39,136
Don't tell me this is the only reason
you wanted me back.

144
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,530
Hey, that's hurtful.

145
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:43,990
Whatever you want to eat, Dongha,
we'll make it for you, three meals a day!

146
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:45,700
That might be a bit much...

147
00:13:46,260 --> 00:13:48,340
After we eat, you guys
want to play some basketball?

148
00:13:49,010 --> 00:13:50,010
No?

149
00:13:50,380 --> 00:13:51,800
Gyumin hates basketball.

150
00:13:51,820 --> 00:13:53,636
Doesn't he just hate it
because he sucks at it?

151
00:13:53,660 --> 00:13:56,000
Yeah... He's not exactly athletic.

152
00:13:56,150 --> 00:13:57,206
What are you talking about?

153
00:13:57,230 --> 00:13:58,466
I'm definitely better than any human.

154
00:13:58,490 --> 00:14:01,196
Hey, I don't like the sound of that
"human" remark. We'll see who wins!

155
00:14:01,220 --> 00:14:02,510
Okay! Bring it on!

156
00:14:02,580 --> 00:14:04,530
Cha Eun-ho, you're on our team, right?

157
00:14:04,990 --> 00:14:06,510
Hey, you can't just claim Eun-ho like that.

158
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:07,840
That's cheating!

159
00:14:08,010 --> 00:14:09,210
Han Dongha.

160
00:14:11,450 --> 00:14:12,450
What about me?

161
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:14,540
Eun-ho! I'm definitely better than Gyumin.

162
00:14:14,710 --> 00:14:16,770
That's nonsense. He's terrible.

163
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,000
I'm speechless.

164
00:14:24,230 --> 00:14:25,240
You really want to play?

165
00:14:25,250 --> 00:14:25,720
Of course.

166
00:14:26,090 --> 00:14:28,050
You have to be on my side.

167
00:14:28,210 --> 00:14:29,210
Got it?

168
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:31,370
Of course. I'm always on your side.

169
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:35,980
It's so hot.

170
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:38,880
But...

171
00:14:40,490 --> 00:14:42,290
what did you mean by
what you said back then?

172
00:14:43,260 --> 00:14:44,260
What did I say?

173
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:46,710
"How could I ever...
with someone like you..."

174
00:14:46,830 --> 00:14:47,830
Isn't that what you said?

175
00:14:48,140 --> 00:14:49,140
What about it?

176
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,440
No.

177
00:14:51,770 --> 00:14:53,910
How could I...

178
00:14:54,270 --> 00:14:55,780
fall for someone like you?

179
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,760
That's probably what you meant, right?

180
00:14:58,240 --> 00:14:59,420
Are... you crazy?

181
00:14:59,490 --> 00:15:00,690
Then what was it?

182
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,510
I don't know. Just stop asking.

183
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:08,310
I need some time to think...

184
00:15:11,500 --> 00:15:12,800
Then let's find out.

185
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,120
Huh?

186
00:15:16,150 --> 00:15:17,150
What those words...

187
00:15:18,260 --> 00:15:19,260
really meant.

188
00:15:23,150 --> 00:15:24,350
Let's find out right now.

189
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:17,030
Having fun?

190
00:16:23,410 --> 00:16:24,410
How about this?

191
00:16:24,460 --> 00:16:26,470
Hey! We're in a library.

192
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:27,550
So what?

193
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:30,260
Jeez...

194
00:16:32,410 --> 00:16:33,610
Do you like me that much?

195
00:16:33,710 --> 00:16:34,710
Yes.

196
00:16:39,230 --> 00:16:40,560
Since when?

197
00:16:41,150 --> 00:16:42,150
Hmm...

198
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,120
From the very beginning,

199
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:48,070
I found myself strangely drawn to you.

200
00:16:49,930 --> 00:16:51,350
Whenever you were out of my sight,

201
00:16:52,710 --> 00:16:54,270
I'd always find myself looking for you.

202
00:17:33,050 --> 00:17:36,060
"My Secret Vampire"

